props":{},"children":["04"]},"Two main benefits for college students joining the military: up to 20,000 RMB per year for tuition, two-year extension of student status, and a special postgraduate admission program"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Three key financial aspects after discharge: one-time separation pay, military service counting toward work seniority, and tax deductions for self-employed veterans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Teachers in the Special Post Program who complete three years of service, pass evaluations, and wish to stay should be promptly added to the official teaching staff"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Firefighters and civilian personnel in the military represent two additional pathways for public recruitment, with lower entry requirements than civil service exams"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Education is not a one-time deal: self-study exams have no age or prior education limits; both adult college entrance exams and open universities offer pathways to further education"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/31-11","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Food delivery workers, ride‑hailing drivers, and local freight carriers all get occupational injury coverage paid for by the platform on a per‑order basis — at no cost to them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Two pathways to secure a government job on the day you fill out college applications: government-funded teacher training and targeted medical student programs, at the cost of a six-year service commitment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Before going abroad to work, check whether the company has a license for international labor cooperation: it is illegal for them to demand a deposit from you"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Working remotely for a foreign company from home: this income is considered domestic earnings for tax purposes; you must file your own individual income tax returns, and incoming payments should be reported as “employee compensation”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Starting a business without joining a company? First look at startup guarantee loans: up to 300,000 RMB per individual, with the government covering half the interest"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/31"},"children":["Chapter 31"," ·"," ","What options are available after turning 18?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"31-11"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["11"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Not being employed by a company doesn’t mean you’re exempt from social insurance; it simply means no employer covers half of the cost. Official documents require all regions to lift household registration barriers so flexible workers can enroll in insurance at their place of work, with major metropolises gradually implementing this change. So don’t mistake “freedom” for “no need to worry about social insurance.” If you fail to pay on schedule, both your pension benefits and medical reimbursement rates will be calculated according to rules for interrupted coverage."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["You must pay the full amount for both pension and medical…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["These provisions stem from the “Guiding Opinions on Protecting the Labor Rights and Interests of Workers in Ne…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["You must pay the full amount for both pension and medical insurance yourself, calculated based on the local contribution base — often over a thousand yuan per month. The contribution base is simply the benchmark figure used to determine premiums. This is the most easily overlooked recurring expense on this path, and the difficulty lies in making those payments on time every month."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["These provisions stem from the “Guiding Opinions on Protecting the Labor Rights and Interests of Workers in New Forms of Employment.” It states: “All regions must lift household registration restrictions so flexible workers can enroll in basic pension and medical insurance at their place of work; for exceptionally large cities where full implementation isn’t immediately feasible, local authorities should create conditions for gradual rollout. Employers must be urged to enroll workers in social insurance per the law. Workers who don’t qualify for standard employee pension or medical plans should be guided to enroll in urban/rural resident programs to ensure full coverage. For those operating independently via platforms, rights and obligations are governed by civil law.” (National policy, effective 2021)"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["人力资源社会保障部等八部门 (2021). 关于维护新就业形态劳动者劳动保障权益的指导意见（人社部发〔2021〕56 号，第二、八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/23/content_5626761.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/23/content_5626761.htm"]},"；国务院办公厅 (2020). 关于支持多渠道灵活就业的意见（国办发〔2020〕27 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-07/31/content_5531613.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-07/31/content_5531613.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/23/content_5626761.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["The original says “lift” household registration restrictions and leaves an exception for very large cities; it does not say they have “already been abolished nationwide.” Ask the city where you intend to enroll how far the restrictions have been lifted. The benefit is rated “high” because interrupted contributions cost you pension and medical benefits themselves, worth far more than ten thousand yuan. But the cost is real too: paying the full amount yourself costs over a thousand yuan a month. For how to make up missed social insurance contributions and accumulate contribution years, see Section 7, item 18 (interrupted social insurance contributions). For how to transfer pension and medical insurance after moving to another city, see Section 19, item 19 (transfer pension and medical insurance to your new place of enrollment). For which contribution tier to choose when paying into employee pension insurance yourself, and how many years of pension payments it takes to break even, see Section 5, item 46 (paying into employee pension insurance yourself). Also, selling agricultural products and daily necessities at government-designated places and times, or using your own skills to provide convenient services that legally require no permit, does not require a business license. This is stated in State Council General Office Document No. 27 (2020)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Education is not a one-time deal: self-study exams have no age or prior education limits; both adult college entrance exams and open universities offer pathways to further education"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Food delivery workers, ride‑hailing drivers, and local freight carriers all get occupational injury coverage paid for by the platform on a per‑order basis — at no cost to them"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},